=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLO PRACTICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/ecba7728eb13499a19ebb023a72917f9.poster.avif?t=1782787329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/ecba7728eb13499a19ebb023a72917f9.webm?t=1782787329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/ecba7728eb13499a19ebb023a72917f9.mp4?t=1782787329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks &amp; Customization: </strong>Complete challenges, score new gear, and show off just enough to make your friends wildly jealous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/9fdbe55a8dc4eb33619e7e9f5c923e77.poster.avif?t=1782787329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/9fdbe55a8dc4eb33619e7e9f5c923e77.webm?t=1782787329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/9fdbe55a8dc4eb33619e7e9f5c923e77.mp4?t=1782787329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off-the-Wall Obstacles:</strong> Sabotage every shot with floppy sharks, dust devils, ectoplasm, mouse traps, portals, and all kinds of chaotic tr